Presents an actionable terminal activities menu at text console login,
offering orientation, curated games and simulations (D214), and an explicit
option to launch the graphical desktop.

Invariants (D215):
- Opening this menu NEVER starts graphics.
- Choosing a terminal activity or game NEVER starts graphics.
- The desktop starts ONLY through explicit selection of the desktop action.
- Exits cleanly back to the text login shell prompt.
"""

